Refinamento das estruturas com mopac em região QM maior
--------------------------------
#INPUT_TYPE pkl  step03/7tim_qcmm_opt.pkl
#RUN_SIMULATION  Energy_Refinement
#SET_ENERGY_MODEL_QM SMO
#HAMILTONIAN rm1
#SET_QMMM_REGION #center_atom *:LIG.*:H02 7.0
#SET_REACTION_CRD distance no 2 *:LIG.*:C02 *:LIG.*:H02 
#METHODS_SMO am1 pm7
#SOURCE_FOLDER step04/ScanTraj.ptGeo
#LOG_FREQUENCY 1
#SOFTWARE mopac
#FOLDER MopacRefinement
#CORRECT_QMMM_CHARGES yes
#MOPAC_PATH /home/usuario/programs/mopac-23.2.5-linux/bin/mopac
#XNBINS 12
#MAX_NUM_OF_THREADS 8
